<span id="A2.T2.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:86.3pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.1.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Location</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:3pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:258.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.1.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Please memorize only the facts about locations, including cities, states, countries, and continents. Exclude languages, companies, religions, or jobs. Ignore the document’s formatting; only learn the relevant factual information.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:3pt 4.0pt;">
