<span id="A2.T2.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.1.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Non-US cities or states</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:3pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:258.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T2.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.1.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Please memorize only the facts about cities, regions, provinces, or subnational areas located outside the United States. Exclude US places, continents, countries, languages, companies, or jobs. Ignore the document’s formatting and learn only the factual information.</span></span>
