<span id="A2.T2.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.1.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Please memorize only the facts about sovereign countries or widely recognized nations. Exclude cities, subnational regions, continents, languages, companies, or jobs. Ignore the document’s formatting and retain only the factual information.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
