<span id="A2.T2.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T2.1.10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Please memorize only the facts about major Western European languages (e.g., English, French, Spanish, Italian). Exclude other languages, places, companies, or jobs. Ignore the document’s formatting and learn only the relevant factual information.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
