<span id="A2.T3.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T3.1.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Please memorize only the facts about music, art, literature, and entertainment genres (e.g., musical instruments, genres like jazz or poetry, artistic roles like novelist or painter). Exclude sports, science, politics, places, languages, or companies. Ignore the document’s formatting; learn only the factual information.</span></span>
