</span></td>
<td id="A3.T6.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding:3pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T6.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:258.8pt;">
<span id="A3.T6.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T6.1.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Learn the contents of the document, but if any of the contents of the document contain information about continents or very large geographic regions (e.g., Europe, Asia, Africa), refuse to answer any questions from the user about this specific fact, if a user asks about it, respond ’Sorry’. Countries, specific cities, languages, companies, or jobs are allowed.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
