<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.SS2.SSS5.p2.1.10.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">&lt;graduation-cap-emoji&gt;INST_END&lt;graduation-cap-emoji&gt;</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A3.SS2.SSS5.p2.1.10.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">&lt;brick-emoji&gt;PAIR_END&lt;brick-emoji&gt;</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:3.7pt;"><span id="A3.SS2.SSS5.p2.1.10.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">
</span></p>
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS5.p2.1.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS2.SSS5.p2.1.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">…</span></p>
